/*
 * A seagull swoops down after you reel in a catch and tries to steal your fish. You can try to shoo it with an athletics check or just give it the fish.
 * If the fish is too large, the seagull will just try to take it, fail, and walk away embarrassed.
 */
:: Fishing Seagull Shoo
<<effects>>
<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		You <span class="green">wave your hand at it</span>.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		You <span class="green">stamp your foot and swing your arms at it</span>.
	<<else>>
		You <span class="green">grab for the fish, shoving the seagull away</span>.
	<</if>>
	The seagull <span class="green">startles and backs away</span>, then flies off over the water.
	<br><br>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
		<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Beach Keep]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [["Throw the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " back"|Fishing Beach Throw Back]]>><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Beach Cat Eat]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
		<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Pier Keep]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [["Throw the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " back"|Fishing Pier Throw Back]]>><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Pier Cat Eat]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
		<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Coast Path Keep]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [["Throw the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " back"|Fishing Coast Path Throw Back]]>><</link>>
		<<if _canEatFish>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Coast Path Cat Eat]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Despite your efforts, the seagull darts in and snatches the fish right from your hand and flies off with it.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
		<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
		<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
		<<link [[Next|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Seagull Give
<<effects>>
You hold the <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> out. The seagull eyes it, then takes it from your hand and flies off.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<if $bus is "fishingBeach">>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $bus is "fishingPier">>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $bus is "fishingCoastPath">>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

/* ========================= */
/* ===== Catch Widgets ===== */
/* ========================= */

:: Widgets Fishing Seagull Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingSeagullCaught">>
	<<set _fish to _args[0]>>
	<<set _fishingLocation to _args[1]>>
	<<effects>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.seagullSteal to true>>
	<<run updateFishRecord(_fish.type, _fish.size, _fishingLocation)>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set _fishPropName to "caught-" + _fish.type>>
	<<wearProp _fishPropName>>

	<<fishingCatchFishText _fish>>
	<br><br>

	<<if _fish.size gte 120>>
		A seagull circles overhead, spots the <<print _fish.type>>, and lands beside you. It clamps its beak onto the fish and heaves. Nothing moves. It heaves again, harder, and still the fish doesn't budge. The seagull gives it one last look, then waddles then waddles away with the energy of a creature that has decided this never happened.
		<br><br>

		<<if _fishingLocation is "fishingBeach">>
			<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Beach Keep]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [["Throw the " + _fish.type + " back"|Fishing Beach Throw Back]]>><</link>>
		<<elseif _fishingLocation is "fishingPier">>
			<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Pier Keep]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [["Throw the " + _fish.type + " back"|Fishing Pier Throw Back]]>><</link>>
		<<elseif _fishingLocation is "fishingCoastPath">>
			<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Coast Path Keep]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [["Throw the " + _fish.type + " back"|Fishing Coast Path Throw Back]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		A seagull lands nearby and eyes your <<print _fish.type>>. After a moment it hops forward and lunges for your catch.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Shoo it away|Fishing Seagull Shoo]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 200>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Let it have the fish|Fishing Seagull Give]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
